<title>MEXICO: Mexican crude ports Pajaritos, Dos Bocas closed.</title>
<headline>Mexican crude ports Pajaritos, Dos Bocas closed.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key Mexican crude oil ports of Pajaritos and Dos Bocas plus the port of Tuxpan were closed on Sunday due to choppy seas with waves of up to eight feet, the Communications and Transport Ministry said.</p>
<p>For the second straight day, ports along the Gulf of Mexico have been closed because of rough conditions linked to a cold front coming from the North that has generated high winds and cloudy skies.</p>
</text>
